{
    "word": "irredeemable",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "81686f88-2452-3819-9683-3736e59e8892",
                "word": "irredeemable",
                "pos": "adj",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "7000bd5d-abe1-38b0-a2cd-5235482472d5",
                        "entry_id": "81686f88-2452-3819-9683-3736e59e8892",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Not redeemable; not able to be restored, recovered, revoked, or escaped."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ec66a3b5-a7a2-4c0b-8b07-c63f7fca1193",
                                "sense_id": "7000bd5d-abe1-38b0-a2cd-5235482472d5",
                                "text": "It wavered an instant—then there was a heartrending crash—and the canary-coloured cart, their pride and their joy, lay on its side in the ditch, an irredeemable wreck."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "af3ba79f-715f-40b8-86cb-d264769feabe",
                                "sense_id": "7000bd5d-abe1-38b0-a2cd-5235482472d5",
                                "text": "She was horribly frightened; but she had pledged her word now, and it was irredeemable."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "678d4709-ea9b-36fc-b3e9-561b137a7a09",
                        "entry_id": "81686f88-2452-3819-9683-3736e59e8892",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Not able to be cancelled by a payment or converted to another form of currency or financial instrument, especially one considered more secure or reliable."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "usually"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0851550f-8dc6-4290-aca4-6e529d55f5a9",
                                "sense_id": "678d4709-ea9b-36fc-b3e9-561b137a7a09",
                                "text": "The subscribers to a new loan, who mean generally to sell their subscription as soon as possible, prefer greatly a perpetual annuity, redeemable by parliament, to an irredeemable annuity, for a long term of years, of only equal amount."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3d4d0687-73f7-442c-8b68-9bae67159e31",
                                "sense_id": "678d4709-ea9b-36fc-b3e9-561b137a7a09",
                                "text": "Investors have always had to trust somebody or something. . . . But they have not always had to make a leap of faith about a nation's irredeemable paper currency. Up until Aug. 15, 1971 the dollar was exchangeable into gold at the rate of $35 to the ounce."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "eb7e2006-c56e-44b7-a13f-b01299135bab",
                        "source_entry_id": "81686f88-2452-3819-9683-3736e59e8892",
                        "source_sense_description": "not able to be restored",
                        "target_lang_word": "onherstelbaar",
                        "target_lang_code": "nl",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "onherstelbaar",
                                "target_lang_code": "nl",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "926c583d-c10f-3bf9-84ad-1e373d4a21da",
                                        "entry_id": "fa88db67-5633-3397-a039-12b3fe136859",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "niet meer te repareren"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fc121ee1-a55d-429a-b589-7b461989bf99",
                                                "sense_id": "926c583d-c10f-3bf9-84ad-1e373d4a21da",
                                                "text": "De onherstelbare auto werd total loss verklaard."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "428a1c73-4b62-459f-8014-a5580edd0aca",
                                                "sense_id": "926c583d-c10f-3bf9-84ad-1e373d4a21da",
                                                "text": "Tijdens de hobbelige rit op zijn reusachtige wagen krijgen we een goed overzicht van de schade in het stadje. Het is een kilometerslange parade van gehavende bankstellen, kasten, matrassen en andere spullen langs de weg. Ze zijn meegesleurd door het water en de wind en onherstelbaar beschadigd. Dit zijn niet alleen de sporen van Milton, maar ook van orkaan Helene die op 26 september noordelijker in Florida aan land kwam."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f5cac703-eeb5-4ed4-8a20-4b8943ab5f04",
                        "source_entry_id": "81686f88-2452-3819-9683-3736e59e8892",
                        "source_sense_description": "not able to be restored",
                        "target_lang_word": "irrémédiable",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "irrémédiable",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f6367c05-40da-321d-a4ba-1256235380a6",
                                        "entry_id": "7a3e3ea0-b6b4-3992-b8ef-c4236aaccc22",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "À quoi on ne peut remédier."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5ed24cb6-df4e-46f9-a086-61d5668647ac",
                                                "sense_id": "f6367c05-40da-321d-a4ba-1256235380a6",
                                                "text": "Sommes-nous donc dans une époque d’irrémédiable décadence ? Plus nous approchons de la fin de ce siècle, plus notre décomposition s’aggrave et s’accélère."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1b351ce0-0235-4459-8c77-f25eee247c8e",
                                                "sense_id": "f6367c05-40da-321d-a4ba-1256235380a6",
                                                "text": "Le conflit est donc irrémédiable (dans la névrose) et irrésolvable entre un trop tôt et un trop tard : seul pourra l'apaiser un fantasme avec sa mise en drame..."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c607986f-3fd2-33d4-9b07-89ac3b69b46f",
                                        "entry_id": "7a3e3ea0-b6b4-3992-b8ef-c4236aaccc22",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Définitif."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fb9bc4b4-724e-4a7e-92c3-f11707239f01",
                                                "sense_id": "c607986f-3fd2-33d4-9b07-89ac3b69b46f",
                                                "text": "L’esclavage n'entraînait pas du reste un abaissement irrémédiable, et on voyait au makhzen des affranchis parvenir aux fonctions les plus élevées."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "irrémédiable",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5badb782-15b1-33e9-a383-e0c853a07d2b",
                                        "entry_id": "9b26f328-82d2-3ad6-afad-579fe4b64e7d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Ce qui ne peut être empêché, ce qui est inévitable."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0bf0bc2f-7d57-481e-9306-57cc8d80e965",
                                                "sense_id": "5badb782-15b1-33e9-a383-e0c853a07d2b",
                                                "text": "Elle s’efforçait de se rendormir, de ne plus penser, mais, quand elle ne pensait pas, elle gardait le même sentiment d’irrémédiable."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b2a1c061-d242-466d-b75c-63660d938656",
                                                "sense_id": "5badb782-15b1-33e9-a383-e0c853a07d2b",
                                                "text": "Elle sait qu’on ne lui montre le monde qu’à travers des vitres bien lavées et souvent voilées de tulle, mais le peu qu’elle en voit lui montre presque partout l’irrémédiable."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
